                <pb facs="0651" n="539" sameAs="frus:frus1919Russia/pg539"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.00/5504: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Tenney</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-10-28"><hi rendition="#italic">October 28,
                        1919</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received October 28, 10:45 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>[From Harris:]</p>
                <p>447. October 28th, 4 p.m. Am informed that Kolchak has just recalled Rozanoff
                    from Vladivostok to Omsk to explain himself. This probably means definite
                    elimination of Rozanoff from Far East situation. Harris.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Tenney</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
